IMPORTANT NOTICE — ETHICAL USE:

This software is designed as a reflective and practical support tool for
everyday emotional and social challenges. It is NOT a replacement for
licensed mental health professionals, clinical diagnosis, or medical treatment.

Any use of this software that intentionally circumvents the built-in safety
guardrails, crisis protocols, or ethical methodology described in the
system prompt is prohibited and contrary to the intent of this project.

The identity and behavioral methodology of Ancora AI (as defined in
src/agent/prompts.py) are integral to the project and must not be modified
to remove safety, anti-manipulation, or crisis detection features in any
derivative work presented as a welfare or mental health tool.
